# UI conventions

## Features

- One folder per feature under `src/features/`.
- Wire routes in `AppNavigator` or the feature’s own navigator.
- Prefer existing sheets/screens patterns (form sheets, detail sheets).

## Design system

- Import tokens from `@/design-system/tokens` (or theme).
- Use **namespaced** colors only: `colors.brand.primary`, `colors.status.danger` — no flat `colors.primary`.
- Money display: typography money variants (tabular nums) / `MoneyCard`.
- Reuse `src/components/core/*` before inventing new primitives.

## i18n

- No hardcoded user-visible strings.
- Keys: semantic, stable (`income.selectService`, not `text1`).

## Product feel

- Fast consumer-payments feel, not accounting ERP chrome.
- Daily ops must work offline; sync status is visible but non-blocking.
